# Confidential/source data — never commit. Broad patterns on purpose: any
# folder with "input" in its name, anywhere in the tree, plus the raw data
# file types themselves as a second layer of protection.
**/*[Ii]nput*/
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xlsm
**/*.pptx
output/

